#ASSERT `s 462.37(4)(a) the term of imprisonment to be imposed in default of payment of the fine` 100000 EQUALS JUST (`s 462.37(4) band` OF (`ccc14 test months` 18), (`ccc14 test years` 2))
#ASSERT `s 462.37(4)(a) the term of imprisonment to be imposed in default of payment of the fine` 100000.01 EQUALS JUST (`s 462.37(4) band` OF (`ccc14 test years` 2), (`ccc14 test years` 3))
#ASSERT `s 462.37(4)(a) the term of imprisonment to be imposed in default of payment of the fine` 250000 EQUALS JUST (`s 462.37(4) band` OF (`ccc14 test years` 2), (`ccc14 test years` 3))
#ASSERT `s 462.37(4)(a) the term of imprisonment to be imposed in default of payment of the fine` 250000.01 EQUALS JUST (`s 462.37(4) band` OF (`ccc14 test years` 3), (`ccc14 test years` 5))
#ASSERT `s 462.37(4)(a) the term of imprisonment to be imposed in default of payment of the fine` 1000000 EQUALS JUST (`s 462.37(4) band` OF (`ccc14 test years` 3), (`ccc14 test years` 5))
#ASSERT `s 462.37(4)(a) the term of imprisonment to be imposed in default of payment of the fine` 1000000.01 EQUALS JUST (`s 462.37(4) band` OF (`ccc14 test years` 5), (`ccc14 test years` 10))
#ASSERT `s 462.37(4)(a) the term of imprisonment to be imposed in default of payment of the fine` 5000000 EQUALS JUST (`s 462.37(4) band` OF (`ccc14 test years` 5), (`ccc14 test years` 10))
